    "rule": "Exact ICPN applicability is explicit in bindings; catalog-owned fields are read from the current Production Catalog exact identity/eStore evidence, RAM and Operating VDD come only from ST Product Selector/eStore observations, and I/O Supply plus VDDA remain null until directly evidenced by those allowed surfaces. No Datasheet, Programming Guide, OpenOCD, or family-name fallback is permitted."
